## Third-party content

This repository incorporates material adapted from **coldoutboundskills**:

- Source: https://github.com/growthenginenowoslawski/coldoutboundskills
- Author: GrowthEngineX (https://growthengine-x.com)
- License: MIT

That material was adapted rather than copied verbatim: upstream YAML frontmatter was
removed, content was reorganised into this repository's reference layout, and cross
references were remapped to local paths. Each adapted file carries a provenance comment
at the top naming its upstream skill. The original MIT terms continue to apply to that
content.

### What was adapted

| Upstream | Landed as |
|---|---|
| `email-deliverability-audit`, `zapmail-domain-setup-public`, `smartlead-inbox-manager`, `deliverability-incident-response`, `inbox-lifecycle-manager` | `skills/gtm-outbound/references/infra/` |
| `playbooks/clay-playbooks` + 19 signal playbooks | `skills/gtm-outbound/references/signals/` |
| `cold-email-weekly-rhythm`, `positive-reply-scoring`, `deliverability-test-public` | `skills/gtm-outbound/references/ops/` |
| `smartlead-api`, `prospeo-search-api` | `skills/gtm-outbound/references/api/` |
| List, offer, copy, experiment and personalization skills | `skills/gtm-outbound/references/` (folded into existing stages) |
| TypeScript scripts | `skills/gtm-outbound/optional/scripts/` (optional, not part of the zero-dependency core) |

### What was deliberately not taken

- `auto-research-public` — it launches campaigns autonomously, which contradicts this
  repository's rule that the skills never send anything themselves.
- The bundled lead CSVs (~525 MB). See `docs/cold-merge/LIST-SOURCES.md` for where those
  live upstream.
